# D-4: obs_reset_video walks the canvas list with the wrong hash handle and therefore skips private
# canvases: they are not cleared, not restored and receive no video_reset signal, yet their mix is
# freed together with the others (the canvas keeps a stale mix pointer). Observable: has_video stays
# 1 while the canvas is missing from the mix list, and the core logs "remaining views: 1".
# A conforming implementation MUST treat private canvases like public ones (clear, restore, signal).
startup en-US -
reset_video fmt=BGRA gpu=0
canvas_create a Public video=1 base=64x64 out=64x64 fmt=BGRA gpu=0
canvas_create_private p Private video=1 base=64x64 out=64x64 fmt=BGRA gpu=0
mixes
sig_canvas a video_reset
sig_canvas p video_reset
reset_video fmt=BGRA gpu=0
mixes
canvas_info a
canvas_info p
shutdown
